Officer Smith is a patrolman of the [[Blackline]], the subscription police company in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. He is the talkative half of a pair, friendly and quick to give his badge number. He and his silent partner Mute had been patrolling the poorer streets around [[Sableclutch Scrap]] for a few weeks, and questioned the party there after a pickpocket ran off. He offered to pass word to [[Copperjaw]] if the thief was caught.
